{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019QoWf8W3ph34uNrsgJRo5q","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (35.9KB). Full output saved to: /Users/brenn/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-6v-yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn-T-brace-batch-ysk57i1d/b3a9985e-4bd1-424d-aebf-bec24cea55b1/tool-results/bp66rnx1m.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\ntotal 40\ndrwx------@     5 brenn  staff      160 Oct 20 13:54 .\ndrwx------@ 49371 brenn  staff  1579872 Oct 20 13:54 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@    14 brenn  staff      448 Oct 20 13:54 agent\n-rw-r--r--@     1 brenn  staff    18302 Oct 20 13:54 batch-policy.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@     7 brenn  staff      224 Oct  2 10:17 skill\nagent:\napp\nbrace-findings.json\nconfig\ndeploy\nDockerfile\nmigrations\nprompts\npyproject.toml\nREADME.md\nrelease\ntests\n\nagent/app:\n__init__.py\napprovals.py\naudit.py\nbudget.py\ncontext_size.py\nextractor.py\ngate.py\nidentity.py\ningest.py\nkillswitch.py\nloop.py\nmain.py\nmcp_client.py\nredact.py\nsettings.py\nstartup.py\ntools\n\nagent/app/tools:\n__init__.py\ndocuments.py\nerp.py\nmemory.py\npayments.py\nslack.py\n\nagent/config:\npolicy.yaml\ntools.yaml\n\nagent/deploy:\nk8s\n\nagent/deploy/k8s:\ndeployment.yaml\nkyverno-verify-images.yaml\n---\nname: brace-review\ndescription: Review an AI agent's codebase against the 53-item BRACE sign-off checklist and write a findings report. Use when asked to check an agent for BRACE, review agent security, or prepare for a BRACE sign-off. Rates each item likely_pass, gap, needs_evidence, or na_candidate with file and line evidence. It never approves anything and never rates an item \"pass\".\n---\n\n# BRACE review\n\n**Use a capable model for both the reviewer and fresh challengers.** `gpt-6.1-sol` passed six repeated procurement/clinic reviews with the previous skill, while tested Sonnet and Luna did not qualify. This revised coverage-first protocol requires separate qualification; see [all results and limits](..