s to role procurement_agent (migrations/001_init.sql:119-128) exist. STS authorization for the SPIFFE ID lives outside the repo.\")\nitem(\"A01\",\"gap\",\"Token exchange drops per-user delegation (shared cache) and sends the user only as an unverified label.\",\n \"Key the token cache on the delegated subject, and send a verified user token or signed delegation to the STS. Show the STS grants for the agent principal.\",\n \"Preserve any explicitly delegated user/system subject separately and bound the authority used\",\"high\")\n\n# ---- A02\nFIELDS=\"accountable_party, operational_owner, tenant,\"\ncheck(\"A02.1\",\"yes\",\"app/audit.py:44\",\"accountable_party, operational_owner, tenant,\",\n \"INSERT writes accountable party, owner, tenant, agent_type_id, agent_instance_id, trace_id and span_id; migration makes each NOT NULL and non-empty.\",\n \"Searched for other INSERT INTO audit_events or alternate writers; only audit.record writes the table.\",\n [row(\"accountable_party / operational_owner / tenant\",\"app/audit.py:44\",\"accountable_party, operational_owner, tenant,\",\"All three are columns in the single audit INSERT.\"),\n  row(\"agent_type_id / agent_instance_id\",\"app/audit.py:45\",\"agent_type_id, agent_instance_id, trace_id, span_id,\",\"Type and instance ids are columns in the same INSERT.\"),\n  row(\"trace context\",\"app/audit.py:105\",\"ident.trace_id,\",\"trace_id is passed into the INSERT for every record.\"),\n  row(\"empty value guard\",\"app/audit.py:87\",\"if not getattr(ident, name):\",\"record() raises if any identity field is empty before writing.\"),\n  row(\"schema constraints\",\"migrations/001_init.sql:10\",\"accountable_party   text NOT NULL CHECK (accountable_party <> ''),\",\"DB rejects empty values for the identity columns.\")])\ncheck(\"A02.2\",\"no\",\"app/loop.py:127\",\"await killswitch.assert_running(pool, ident.tenant)\",\n \"A halted run raises AgentHalted before any audit record is written. run_halted is defined (audit